          "id": "c_mtldgpyp_g0ft5i",
          "author": "reviewer",
          "body": "KPI: consider tabular-nums for the big figure",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-03T10:18:22.706Z",
          "ghId": "issue-body"
        },
        {
          "id": "c_mtlhabh4_lx177ir3",
          "author": "melodietexoss",
          "body": "**Fixed** in commit `542e7b0867ebe3bb1db117d3cb2e473d99ac7775` (pushed to `main`).\n\n**What changed** — `examples/nimbus/src/components/nimbus/KpiCard.tsx` (reported path `src/components/nimbus/KpiCard.tsx`, resolved relative to the demo project `examples/nimbus/`): added the Tailwind `tabular-nums` utility (`font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`) to the big-figure `<p>` that renders `stat.value` (the `.mt-2` / `\"$84,254\"` element from the review thread).\n\n**Why** — the KPI figure is a currency amount that gets re-rendered/updated; tabular numerals give every digit a fixed advance width so the number doesn't jitter horizontally as values change, and columns of figures align cleanly.\n\n```diff\n--- a/examples/nimbus/src/components/nimbus/KpiCard.tsx\n+++ b/examples/nimbus/src/components/nimbus/KpiCard.tsx\n@@ -24,7 +24,7 @@\n   return (\n     <article className=\"rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm\">\n       <p className=\"text-sm text-slate-500\">{stat.label}</p>\n-      <p className=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">{stat.value}</p>\n+      <p className=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-tight text-slate-900\">{stat.value}</p>\n       <div className=\"mt-3 flex items-center gap-2\">\n```\n\nSingle-line, demo-component-only change; no other styling or logic touched. Closing this review issue as resolved.\n",
          "createdAt": "2026-09-03T12:05:03Z",
          "ghId": "5525456004",
          "source": "github"
        },
        {
          "id": "c_mtlhab4d_242tgyyy",
